        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana 55D2012, Contemporary Glass Soap Dish</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe White Frosted Glass Soap Dish is easy to install on nearly any wall as it comes packaged with all the necessary mounting hardware. This Contemporary Glass Soap Holder has a frosted white glass dish supported by a solid brass mounting bracket. The mount is available in your choice of modern finish. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-55D2012-specifications.gif?v=1704354725\" width=\"600\" height=\"218\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana 55D2012 Soap Dish Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShop more of the <a href=\"/search?type=product&q=Deltana 55D Modern Series\"><b>Deltana 55D Series Bathroom Accessories</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Frosted White Glass Soap Dish:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: solid brass wall mount with a glass dish</li>\r\n<li>Glass Color: Frosted White</li>\r\n<li>Soap Dish Length: 3-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Soap Dish Width: 3-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Soap Dish Depth: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 4-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Height: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Width: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw mounting for a clean, contemporary look.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-55D2012-specifications.pdf?v=1691095330\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana 55D2012 Soap Dish Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 soap dish, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>This is a Limited Series. <b>Limited Quantities Available</b></i>\r\n</p>",
