                "description": "The White Frosted Glass Soap Dish is easy to install on nearly any wall as it comes packaged with all the necessary mounting hardware. This Contemporary Glass Soap Holder has a frosted white glass dish supported by a solid brass mounting bracket. The mount is available in your choice of modern finish.",
